        "date_published": "2026-07-18T15:00:21+00:00",
        "description": "If you\u2019re just starting your journey in Palworld, you have likely realized that ore is a heavy, difficult resource to find and continuously harvest. Until you reach Level 24 and unlock your very own Ore Mining Site, scrambling for enough materials can bring your progression to a crawl. Fortunately, there are a couple of methods you can exercise to speed up your progress and save yourself a massive headache.\n\nBy setting up a second base behind the Desolate Church, you can establish a substantial and self-sufficient ore farm. Utilizing Pals like Rushoar for their charge attacks, or Digtoise to grind deposits into dust, will dramatically increase your mining efficiency. Combined with version 1.0's new Easy Bulk Storage feature to manage your weight limit, as well as Foxsparks and Lamballs to automate the smelting and transport, you will secure a steady stream of ore and ingots to power your playthrough.",
