        "description": "Palworld 1.0 introduces dense new milestones for your survival progression, and grabbing a ton of Hardwood is an essential step for the midgame. If you're struggling to spot these specific trees in the wild or just want to figure out the best ways to keep your base's stockpiles full, here is everything you need to know to get chopping.\n\nFinding Hardwood in Palworld requires venturing into higher-level areas like the Twilight Dunes and knowing exactly which trees to hit. Once you locate this valuable lumber, farming Hardwood efficiently means utilizing fast-travel points, setting up satellite bases with Lumbering Pals, and eventually unlocking the Logging Site II facility at level 43. By combining these methods, you can create an infinitely renewable source of materials so you can focus on other challenges across the map.",
